{
  "status": "RECOVERED_FROM_PALMIER_READ_ONLY",
  "project": "/Users/diplomat/Documents/Palmier Pro/Nuviko 009 Black Death Remake 20261102.palmier/project.json",
  "project_sha256": "d2b301a92df02c766225376fae5ebac3560a5f6dcfbbaa9b382463cb111beb6f",
  "timeline_id": "05828824-B1AD-40A4-B897-52E311DD1079",
  "caption_clip_count": 342,
  "clips": [
    {
      "start_frame": 2,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "At a plague cemetery in London,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 63,
      "duration_frames": 100,
      "text": "archaeologists found 181 coins."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 163,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "They lay in the grave of a woman who"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 213,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "died during the epidemic. We do not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 275,
      "duration_frames": 45,
      "text": "know why the money remained with"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 320,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "her. Perhaps people feared infection if"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 390,
      "duration_frames": 37,
      "text": "they removed the dead woman's"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 427,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "clothing. But the same cemetery holds"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 493,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "another important detail. Even in the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 557,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "communal graves, bodies were carefully"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 619,
      "duration_frames": 83,
      "text": "laid out in rows. Fear did not bring all"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 702,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "essential work to a stop. Someone"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 768,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "continued to do it. The cemetery was"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 835,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "established near the Tower of London"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 887,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "when plague reached the city in late"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 953,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "1348. Ordinary burial grounds were"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1022,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "running out of space. People did not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1088,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "know what caused the disease. They had"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1147,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "to decide whether to open the door to a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1199,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "neighbor, care for a sick relative,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1262,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "or go to market. Lives depended on"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1333,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "those decisions. But people often had no"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1400,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "reliable way to tell which choice was"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1458,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "right. How do you protect yourself from"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1520,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "a danger you cannot recognize?"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1577,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "And how do you preserve a city when"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1629,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "everyone is afraid to come close to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1680,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "another person? Medieval Europe was"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1746,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "not a collection of isolated villages."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1814,
      "duration_frames": 84,
      "text": "Cities needed grain, cloth, and metal."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1898,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "Ships sailed between ports, merchants"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 1967,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "carried goods across borders, and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2018,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "people traveled for work and returned"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2070,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "home. This network made life possible"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2146,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "even in places that could not produce"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2198,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "everything they needed. It also created"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2269,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "routes for infection. Animals and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2332,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "parasites moved alongside people and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2393,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "cargo. The disease could cross distances"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2464,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "that no single sick person traveled from"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2528,
      "duration_frames": 92,
      "text": "beginning to end. By the end of 1347,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2620,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "the epidemic was spreading across the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2668,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "Mediterranean. The following year,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2728,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "it swept through Florence, reached"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2781,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "England, and made its way to London."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2846,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "The disaster also affected other parts of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2910,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "Eurasia and North Africa. Looking at a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 2979,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "map, it is tempting to draw a single line"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3050,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "and trace the disease's movement."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3107,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "In reality, there were many routes and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3167,
      "duration_frames": 54,
      "text": "separate outbreaks. Neighboring"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3221,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "regions could experience them very"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3270,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "differently. News of the disaster could"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3332,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "arrive before the disease itself."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3395,
      "duration_frames": 39,
      "text": "People in England knew of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3434,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "approaching danger before the first"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3486,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "local outbreaks. But the warning did not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3555,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "answer the central question. What"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3610,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "should they do now? Behind every point"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3683,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "on the map was a place that still needed"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3743,
      "duration_frames": 78,
      "text": "food. An order could close the gates."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3821,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "An order alone could not feed the people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3881,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "inside. So, authorities faced a problem"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 3957,
      "duration_frames": 78,
      "text": "with no simple solution. How to limit"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4035,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "dangerous connections without"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4083,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "depriving a city of the things it needed to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4146,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "survive? For someone who fell ill,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4223,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "that vast geography meant nothing."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4296,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "A fever began followed by severe"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4359,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "weakness. In the bubonic form of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4422,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "plague, the lymph nodes became"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4474,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "painfully swollen, often in the groin or"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4546,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "under the arms. Sometimes the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4602,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "infection affected the blood or lungs."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4678,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "Today, a doctor knows what infection"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4742,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "such symptoms may indicate. In the 14th"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4815,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "century, people looked for different"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4868,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "explanations. An imbalance within the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 4930,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "body, corrupted air, or the influence of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5007,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "heavenly bodies. Religious beliefs linked"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5084,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "the disaster to punishment for sin."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5156,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "If someone believes the air is dangerous,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5222,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "fragrant herbs and incense seem like"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5280,
      "duration_frames": 54,
      "text": "reasonable protection. They act"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5334,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "according to the knowledge available to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5382,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "them. The problem is that this"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5438,
      "duration_frames": 47,
      "text": "knowledge does not explain what is"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5485,
      "duration_frames": 84,
      "text": "happening. The cause was a bacterium,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5569,
      "duration_frames": 84,
      "text": "Yersinia pestis. It persists in natural"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5653,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "reservoirs among small mammals and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5705,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "their fleas. A person can become"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5764,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "infected through the bite of an infected"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5820,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "flea or through contact with infected"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5884,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "animal tissue. In the pneumonic form,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5958,
      "duration_frames": 40,
      "text": "transmission through respiratory"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 5998,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "droplets is possible during close contact"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6063,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "with a sick person. Scientists are still"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6133,
      "duration_frames": 40,
      "text": "investigating which routes"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6173,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "predominated in different medieval"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6221,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "outbreaks. They also debate the role of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6285,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "parasites that live on humans."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6343,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "A single diagram featuring a rat cannot"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6417,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "confidently explain the entire pandemic."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6491,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "But people around someone who was ill"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6546,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "saw a simpler sequence. One person"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6612,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "became sick, and then someone nearby"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6680,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "became sick, too. Even without"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6741,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "knowledge of bacteria, closeness began"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6808,
      "duration_frames": 86,
      "text": "to inspire fear. And so, a question about"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6894,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "disease became a question about"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 6950,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "another person. When the sick person"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7013,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "was a stranger, you could step away."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7078,
      "duration_frames": 45,
      "text": "But what could you do when the person"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7123,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "who fell ill lived with you?"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7183,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "In Florence, Giovanni Boccaccio"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7240,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "described this change. In the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7291,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "introduction to the Decameron, he"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7342,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "recounts how people tried to survive the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7401,
      "duration_frames": 82,
      "text": "epidemic. Authorities removed refuse,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7483,
      "duration_frames": 43,
      "text": "barred sick people from entering the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7526,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "city, and issued advice on staying"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7584,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "healthy. Measures were taken,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7642,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "but the disaster could not be stopped."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7711,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "Some limited their contact with others,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7770,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "shut themselves away with a small circle"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7825,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "of people, and tried to live moderately."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7899,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "Others drank, visited taverns,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 7956,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "and sought entertainment. Some left the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8024,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "city. This is a work of literature,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8092,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "not a census of how every Florentine"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8150,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "behaved. But it reveals the fear of people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8223,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "who no longer knew which of their"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8271,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "habits were safe. Particularly painful"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8343,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "are the passages about relatives who left"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8398,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "the sick without help. Boccaccio"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8458,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "describes the breaking of bonds people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8521,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "usually rely on in a crisis."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8578,
      "duration_frames": 45,
      "text": "A home, where a person should have"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8623,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "been cared for, could become a place of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8680,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "isolation. Not everyone had the means"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8746,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "to leave. Waiting out the disaster in the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8807,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "countryside required money,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8857,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "shelter, and people to provide for"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8914,
      "duration_frames": 75,
      "text": "everyday life. In the Decameron itself,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 8989,
      "duration_frames": 54,
      "text": "the group that leaves Florence has those"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9043,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "resources. But if everyone leaves,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9111,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "who will bring water to the sick?"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9162,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "Who will bake bread? Who will take"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9215,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "away the dead? This was one of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9272,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "epidemic's hardest contradictions."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9337,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "Staying away from the sick could reduce"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9393,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "the danger to an individual, yet someone"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9460,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "still had to care for those who could no"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9512,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "longer help themselves. And when we"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9564,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "return to the London burials,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9614,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "it becomes clear that a story in which"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9670,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "everyone fled would be incomplete."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9736,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "At the East Smithfield Cemetery,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9787,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "there were individual graves as well as"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9842,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "communal burial trenches. It is easy to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9908,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "imagine the latter as chaotic pits,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 9973,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "but archaeologists found carefully"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10026,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "arranged bodies. The cemetery itself"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10094,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "required organization. Land had to be"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10160,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "set aside, graves dug, the dead brought"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10236,
      "duration_frames": 54,
      "text": "in, and burials carried out."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10290,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "The living did this work in a city where"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10347,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "they too could fall ill. Excavations"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10419,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "cannot tell us what each of them felt,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10477,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "but they show the result of their work."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10537,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "Even amid enormous losses,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10589,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "people were not always buried hastily"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10645,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "and without order. At the same time,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10708,
      "duration_frames": 78,
      "text": "fear could lead to very different actions."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10786,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "Across Europe, false accusations spread"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10863,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "against Jews that they were poisoning"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10923,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "wells and causing the disease."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 10984,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "Long-standing prejudices found a new"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11042,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "justification. Persecution and mass"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11115,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "killings followed. These accusations had"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11186,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "nothing to do with the true cause of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11237,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "plague. People became victims of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11294,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "violence that infection did not make"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11352,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "inevitable. Other people committed it."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11426,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "So, it would be just as wrong to see the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11475,
      "duration_frames": 82,
      "text": "entire era only as a time of mutual help"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11557,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "as it would be to see nothing but cruelty."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11627,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "Evidence of both care and brutality has"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11696,
      "duration_frames": 75,
      "text": "survived. That evidence matters no less"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11771,
      "duration_frames": 38,
      "text": "than what we know about the disease"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11809,
      "duration_frames": 80,
      "text": "itself. Plague placed people in terrible"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11889,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "circumstances, but their actions did not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 11958,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "all amount to the same response. By the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12023,
      "duration_frames": 80,
      "text": "early 1350s, the first wave had weakened"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12103,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "in many places. Plague would return"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12179,
      "duration_frames": 84,
      "text": "again and again, but even now survivors"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12263,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "faced consequences that the end of mass"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12321,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "deaths could not undo. Historical"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12388,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "accounts often cite estimates that"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12440,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "roughly a third or as much as half of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12506,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "Europe's population died. These are not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12572,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "the results of an exact count."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12627,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "Medieval records are incomplete and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12686,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "newer research emphasizes how uneven"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12749,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "the losses were. A percentage calculated"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12819,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "for one city cannot simply be applied to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12884,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "an entire continent. On the ground,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 12951,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "however, the consequences were"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13000,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "tangible. Where many people had died,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13071,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "fields remained with too few hands to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13130,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "work them and workshops were short of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13186,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "workers. Land alone did not produce a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13257,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "harvest. A workshop without a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13308,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "craftsperson could not fill an order."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13375,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "Those who hired labor had to compete"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13431,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "for the people who remained. Some"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13482,
      "duration_frames": 44,
      "text": "workers gained the opportunity to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13526,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "demand higher wages or choose another"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13583,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "employer. For land owners and"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13632,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "workshop owners, this meant higher"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13685,
      "duration_frames": 44,
      "text": "costs and a weakening of their"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13729,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "customary control over other people's"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13785,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "labor. In England, the response included"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13856,
      "duration_frames": 85,
      "text": "an ordinance in 1349 and the Statute of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 13941,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "Laborers passed 2 years later."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14003,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "They attempted to limit wages,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14055,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "workers' movement, and their ability to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14106,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "take better terms elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14158,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "Able-bodied people were required to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14207,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "accept work under the prescribed rules."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14280,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "Surviving did not yet mean freedom to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14340,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "direct one's own life. New opportunities"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14412,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "had to be fought for while those in"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14464,
      "duration_frames": 47,
      "text": "power tried to restore the old"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14511,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "relationships. The plague did not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14571,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "abolish dependence and poverty in a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14621,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "single blow. Its consequences differed"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14689,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "from place to place, but the enormous"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14748,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "losses forced people to confront a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14805,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "question that had once seemed settled."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14872,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "What is human labor worth,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 14930,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "text": "and who has the right to set its price?"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15003,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "Ways of protecting a city from another"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15058,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "outbreak also changed. For a trading"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15128,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "port, the challenge remained the same."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15192,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "Keep disease out without stopping a way"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15251,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "of life that depended on arriving people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15314,
      "duration_frames": 101,
      "text": "and cargo. In 1377, the authorities of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15415,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "Ragusa, today's Dubrovnik,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15471,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "adopted a special rule. People arriving"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15545,
      "duration_frames": 43,
      "text": "from places where the disease was"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15588,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "raging were forbidden to enter the city"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15650,
      "duration_frames": 81,
      "text": "immediately. First, they had to spend 30"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15731,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "days apart in designated places outside"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15805,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "it. The rule also applied to local"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15871,
      "duration_frames": 75,
      "text": "residents returning from infected areas."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15946,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "Even someone with a home in the city"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 15995,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "could be required to wait before going"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16050,
      "duration_frames": 87,
      "text": "back inside. The wait itself was a severe"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16137,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "ordeal. Conditions in the first places of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16207,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "isolation were harsh. Food was brought"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16275,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "in from outside. The decision to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16334,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "separate arrivals immediately created"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16394,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "another obligation, to supply them with"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16458,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "what they needed. Visits to people in"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16517,
      "duration_frames": 58,
      "text": "isolation were restricted, too."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16575,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "The delivery of necessities had to be"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16626,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "arranged separately. Otherwise,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16685,
      "duration_frames": 40,
      "text": "the people coming to help would"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16725,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "themselves defeat the purpose of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16775,
      "duration_frames": 91,
      "text": "isolation. Later, a 40-day period became"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16866,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "widespread. The word quarantine"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16929,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "comes from the Italian word for 40."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 16995,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "Doctors still could not see the pathogen,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17064,
      "duration_frames": 42,
      "text": "but the authorities were already"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17106,
      "duration_frames": 45,
      "text": "changing the way people came into"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17151,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "contact with one another in an effort to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17204,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "reduce risk. They had found a measure"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17265,
      "duration_frames": 49,
      "text": "they could carry out even without a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17314,
      "duration_frames": 67,
      "text": "complete explanation of the disease."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17381,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "It was not a final victory. Plague"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17446,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "returned for centuries, nor did"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17506,
      "duration_frames": 46,
      "text": "quarantine turn a port into an"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17552,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "impregnable fortress. But between"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17614,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "helpless waiting and bringing trade to a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17673,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "complete halt, another course of action"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17735,
      "duration_frames": 61,
      "text": "had emerged, to separate a person's"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17796,
      "duration_frames": 54,
      "text": "arrival from their meeting with the city"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17850,
      "duration_frames": 84,
      "text": "by a period of time. Now, let us return to"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 17934,
      "duration_frames": 72,
      "text": "London, to the cemetery near the tower."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18006,
      "duration_frames": 52,
      "text": "The people buried there did not know"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18058,
      "duration_frames": 53,
      "text": "what had caused their illness, but"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18111,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "something survived in their remains"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18159,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "that allowed researchers to investigate it"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18221,
      "duration_frames": 81,
      "text": "centuries later, fragments of bacterial"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18302,
      "duration_frames": 93,
      "text": "DNA. In 2011, researchers published a"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18395,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "reconstruction of the genome of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18443,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "plague bacterium from the remains of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18494,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "victims of the London epidemic."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18550,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "By then, Yersinia pestis had long been"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18620,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "known to science. Now, researchers"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18680,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "could connect it to particular people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18731,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "who had died during the Black Death"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18788,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "and study an ancient form of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18836,
      "duration_frames": 71,
      "text": "pathogen. Later, another important"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18907,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "trace was found far from Europe in what"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 18973,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "is now Kyrgyzstan. In the Chüy Valley,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19050,
      "duration_frames": 92,
      "text": "gravestones from 1338 and 1339"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19142,
      "duration_frames": 75,
      "text": "survived with references to pestilence."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19217,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "Scientists studied remains from these"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19268,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "burials and found the plague bacterium"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19323,
      "duration_frames": 80,
      "text": "there as well. The findings, published in"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19403,
      "duration_frames": 77,
      "text": "2022, placed the identified strain at the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19480,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "base of a genetic branching associated"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19545,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "with the Black Death. In other words,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19607,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "an important clue to the early history of"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19666,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "the pandemic had emerged from about"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19725,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "10 years before the disaster in Florence"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19789,
      "duration_frames": 65,
      "text": "and London. This is not a map of every"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19854,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "infected person's journey, nor does it"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19916,
      "duration_frames": 68,
      "text": "establish who the first patient was,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 19984,
      "duration_frames": 55,
      "text": "but later theories can now be compared"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20039,
      "duration_frames": 74,
      "text": "with physical traces of the disease itself."
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20113,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "Genetic analysis can identify the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20170,
      "duration_frames": 69,
      "text": "pathogen. To understand how people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20239,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "lived through the disaster, we need"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20290,
      "duration_frames": 63,
      "text": "other evidence, too. Letters,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20353,
      "duration_frames": 62,
      "text": "books, documents, and the burials"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20415,
      "duration_frames": 56,
      "text": "themselves. The arrangement of the"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20471,
      "duration_frames": 57,
      "text": "graves preserves part of that story as"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20528,
      "duration_frames": 64,
      "text": "well. The money remained with the dead"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20592,
      "duration_frames": 76,
      "text": "woman, and beside her lay other people"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20668,
      "duration_frames": 44,
      "text": "buried in an order that someone"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20712,
      "duration_frames": 66,
      "text": "continued to maintain. We do not know"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20778,
      "duration_frames": 51,
      "text": "the names of those who dug the graves"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20829,
      "duration_frames": 50,
      "text": "and brought the dead here. We do not"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20879,
      "duration_frames": 59,
      "text": "know what drove them. Duty,"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 20938,
      "duration_frames": 70,
      "text": "wages, faith, or care for their loved"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 21008,
      "duration_frames": 75,
      "text": "ones. But the city held together in part"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 21083,
      "duration_frames": 60,
      "text": "because of their work. They carried it"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 21143,
      "duration_frames": 48,
      "text": "out without yet knowing what was"
    },
    {
      "start_frame": 21191,
      "duration_frames": 30,
      "text": "killing their neighbors."
    }
  ]
}
